# U49 g (FUP6): Config view against Sub/allflame_exp_030, hovering the comparison build's config
# controls: their tooltipText/tooltipFunc are the entry ConfigTab's (CompareTab.lua:1170-1173,
# 1208; CompareEntry.lua:112): the option help read from the entry build (Low Life: the entry's
# LowLifePercentage), the stat comparison of toggling it on the entry's calc (the entry ConfigTab's
# own calcFunc), an option without a tooltip, the bandit list tooltip (the entry's Alira); then the
# primary build's Low Life control for contrast.
#! u49-import Sub/allflame_exp_030.xml
#! u49-expect-text You will automatically be considered to be on Low
#! u49-expect-text ^8+15% to all Elemental Resistances
#! u49-expect-text ^7Toggling this option will give you:
screen 1280 800 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 122
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 732 138
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 730 446
frames 2
move 730 424
frames 2
move 790 358
frames 2
